# Testing Conventions

## Test Structure

Mirror each file:

```
package/
├── content.js/         # Content script specific logic
├── content.test.js/    # Tests
├── popup.js/           # Display logic
├── popup.test.js/      # Tests
└── ...                 # etc.
```

## Test Organization

- **Unit tests**: Test individual functions/classes in isolation
- **Integration tests**: Test component interactions
- **End-to-end tests**: Test complete workflows

## Testing Tools

- **jest**: Primary testing framework

## Running Tests

```bash
# All tests
npm test
```

## Mocking Guidelines

- Mock external dependencies (APIs, databases, file systems)
- Mock ML model predictions for consistent testing
